<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle trade steady, few sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle trade steady, few sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested, few sales steady, USDA said.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  4 loads and part loads high Select and Choice 2-3 1231-1375 lbs 67.00-68.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  2 loads high Select and Choice 2-3 1110-1325 lbs 67.00-69.50.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
